@base=http://localhost:5000
@id=REPLACE_WITH_APPOINTMENT_ID

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create appointment
POST {{base}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "p1",
  "patientName": "John Doe",
  "doctorId": "d1",
  "doctorName": "Dr. Sarah Wilson",
  "startTime": "2025-07-25T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2025-07-25T10:30:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Follow up"
}

### List
GET {{base}}/api/v1/appointments?doctorId=d1

### Get by id
GET {{base}}/api/v1/appointments/{{id}}

### Update status
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/appointments/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed" }
